  headline: 'Xone:96: the operational reference',
  description: 'What every DJ should know before working an Allen & Heath Xone:96: why a jack left in the master insert return kills the master and the meters, why the master controls do not move the meters at all, the two filters, and the two soundcards.',
  author: { '@id': 'https://www.savemygig.com/#org' },
  publisher: { '@id': 'https://www.savemygig.com/#org' },
  datePublished: '2026-08-07',
  dateModified: '2026-08-07',
  inLanguage: 'en',
